Baity
-----

This project incorporates portions of Baity, a Minecraft utility and
visual mod, by 11YearCookieBuff (also known as shyeuar / raueyhs).

Original project: Baity
Source: https://github.com/raueyhs/Baity
Copyright (C) 2025  raueyhs
License: GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 or later

SmolPeople, NickTweaks and the original presence
synchronization client were adapted from the Baity 1.7.0 / Minecraft
26.2 sources. The unused original Worker and deployment bindings
were removed on 2026-10-11. The upstream project remains the reference
for the original implementation.

Modifications
-------------

On 2026-10-16, adapted FancyDmgSplash number styling and its eight animation
styles from Baity commit d1d4b910e67ca7a318e973ca85cb516800d56e44.
Our implementation adds bounded local queues, a settings preview, strict
SkyBlock label detection and render-only suppression instead of removing entities.

Adapted and modified by the CustomCosmetics contributors in 2026;
this notice records changes through 2026-10-11.

On 2026-10-13, independently implemented continuous nickname gradients and a
gold-white shimmer sweep. The visual reference is not redistributed; the
renderer uses the game's existing glyphs and adds no game-server messages.

Changes include independent namespaces and configuration, a replacement
pink settings GUI, Minecraft version compatibility, modified chat
notifications, and replacement of the original remote synchronization
with a self-hosted Node.js/SQLite service and Mojang session authentication.
The public repository contains the corresponding source for released versions.

CustomCosmetics is a modified derivative project, not an official Baity
release. The original author attribution and copyright notice are
preserved here; they do not grant rights to third-party credentials,
private APIs or unrelated assets.

